      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A new asphalt shingle roof replacement in Utah typically costs between $8,000 and $25,000, with an average home (around 2,000 square feet) ranging from $10,000 to $16,000.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $8,000 and $25,000"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Roofing Financing Options in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Contractor-Partner Financing: Many Utah roofing companies partner with third-party lenders (such as Service Finance Company, GreenSky, and GoodLeap) to offer promotional plans. Common choices include $0-down options, low monthly payment plans, and promotional periods with 0% APR or no-interest for 6 to 18 months (though deferred-interest terms apply if the balance isn't paid in full before the window ends).",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              1,
              2,
              3,
              4
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Home Equity Loans or HELOCs: Secured by your home equity, these typically offer lower interest rates and potential tax deductions, though they require a slower application and closing process.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Unsecured Personal / Home Improvement Loans: Quick funding through banks, credit unions, or online platforms with fixed monthly payments, though they generally carry higher interest rates than secured loans.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Insurance Claims: If your roof suffered storm, wind, or hail damage, your homeowner\u2019s insurance may cover a significant portion or the full replacement cost minus your deductible. Many local contractors specialize in assisting with insurance negotiations and claim paperwork.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              6,
              7,
              8
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Local Utah Contractors Offering Financing"
